# Rust
/target/
**/*.rs.bk
# Coverage profiles an instrumented binary writes where it runs (`cargo llvm-cov`)
*.profraw

# Node / UI
node_modules/
dist/

# Local tooling and editor state
.remember/
.serena/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
.DS_Store

# Emulator runtime data (flash images, SD images, recorded sessions, ROM cache)
*.flash
*.img
*.inkrec
/rom-cache/
# A flash dump or a merged image dropped at the root for `inkemu run --flash` is third-party material:
# it must never be committed. Test fixtures live under crates/*/tests/fixtures/ and are not affected.
/*.bin

# Secrets (signing, notarization)
.env
.env.*
*.p12
*.pem
*.key

# Subagent-driven development scratch (ledger, briefs, reviews)
.superpowers/
